scripts/moe-agent.sh:
- get_account_lease (9085) calls idle_wait in its untrusted and wait branches;
- moe_attempt_read (2585) and pin_attempt_identity (2611);
- the pre-flight pin call at 10011, the lease call at 10741, CLI_LAUNCHED_AT at 10746;
- the pre-flight top re-blanks the pair at 9589;
- live_marker_remove (4012) compares MOE_LIVE_MARKER_LINE.

scripts/moe-agent.ps1:
